{"id": 401, "date": "2026-01-06T21:00:51", "date_gmt": "2026-01-06T12:00:51", "guid": {"rendered": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/?p=401"}, "modified": "2026-01-06T20:35:58", "modified_gmt": "2026-01-06T11:35:58", "slug": "%e3%82%a2%e3%83%8a%e3%82%b6%e3%83%bc%e3%83%93%e3%82%b8%e3%83%a5%e3%82%a2%e3%83%ab%e7%9b%b4%e5%89%8d%e4%ba%88%e5%91%8a%e6%96%b0%e3%82%ad%e3%83%a3%e3%83%a9%e3%82%af%e3%82%bf%e3%83%bc-%e3%82%ad", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/401/", "title": {"rendered": "アナザービジュアル&#038;直前予告&#038;新キャラクター/キャストなど新情報一挙公開！"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p>Netflix映画『超かぐや姫！』の新情報を一挙公開！</p>\n<p>このたび、アナザービジュアルが公開されました！</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-404\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/d939d789512d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1001\" height=\"1417\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/d939d789512d.jpg 212w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/a1f3a75b2785.jpg 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/bd5002811264.jpg 724w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1001px) 100vw, 1001px\" /></p>\n<p>現実世界で過ごすかぐやと彩葉が描かれ、普段の二人の関係性や雰囲気が伝わってくる仕上がりに。<br />\nかぐやと彩葉はどのように絆を深めていくのか、日常の描写も乞うご期待ください！</p>\n<p>あわせて、直前予告を公開！</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"『超かぐや姫！』直前予告映像｜ 2026年1月22日(木) Netflixにて世界独占配信\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XbIRhHAMByI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>ゲーミング電柱から現れ、古典『竹取物語』と同じく急激に成長するかぐや。40mPが本作のために書き下ろした本編楽曲「瞬間シンフォニー」をかぐや（cv.夏吉ゆうこ）が歌唱。かぐやは月に帰ってしまうのか、思い描いたハッピーエンドを迎えることができるのか、結末をお見逃しなく！</p>\n<p><strong>♫ メインテーマ</strong><br />\n<strong>「Ex-Otogibanashi」</strong><br />\n<strong>作詞・作曲・編曲：ryo (supercell)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>♫ 劇中歌<br />\n「瞬間、シンフォニー。」</strong><br />\n<strong>作詞・作曲・編曲：40mP</strong></p>\n<p>さらに、新キャラクター/キャストを一挙公開！</p>\n<p>帝アキラ cv.入野自由</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-408\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/c94f0f3333f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"995\" height=\"1327\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/c94f0f3333f6.png 225w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/65b801b0ab32.png 1152w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/e84de430eaaa.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/c8ec1914afa4.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 995px) 100vw, 995px\" /></p>\n<p>駒沢雷 cv.内田雄馬</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-406\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/26169795bbf6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"987\" height=\"1316\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/26169795bbf6.png 225w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/c4fe9aa20348.png 1152w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/b0ac47b1be9a.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/7a70ff002c06.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 987px) 100vw, 987px\" /></p>\n<p>駒沢乃依 cv. 松岡禎丞</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-407\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/a641c27cbf19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"995\" height=\"1327\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/a641c27cbf19.png 225w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/4abb03e91043.png 1152w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/7c9474bd10e7.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/e1d2274e4555.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 995px) 100vw, 995px\" /></p>\n<p>綾紬芦花 cv.青山吉能</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-411\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/1ca052590eec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"993\" height=\"1324\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/1ca052590eec.png 225w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/222cd2802f17.png 1152w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/25274f3a259d.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/91442daaf456.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 993px) 100vw, 993px\" /></p>\n<p>諌山真実 cv.小原好美</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-410\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/14938fce04e7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"992\" height=\"1323\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/14938fce04e7.png 225w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/114c71dca8af.png 1152w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/f9e83d58f21c.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/3835232a4b78.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 992px) 100vw, 992px\" /></p>\n<p>忠犬オタ公 cv.ファイルーズあい<br />\n乙事照琴 cv.花江夏樹</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-409\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/e6ef88039a8d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"992\" height=\"1323\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/e6ef88039a8d.png 225w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/dc45835345ba.png 1152w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/db5f542e0c00.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/ff080f01689c.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 992px) 100vw, 992px\" /></p>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>Netflix映画『超かぐや姫！』の新情報を一挙公開！ このたび、アナザービジュアルが公開されました！ 現実世界で過ごすかぐやと彩葉が描かれ、普段の二人の関係性や雰囲気が伝わってくる仕上がりに。 かぐやと彩葉はどのように [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 8, 